<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Corp to set up Indian subsidiary in April.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Corp to set up Indian subsidiary in April.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sumitomo Corp said on Wednesday that it will launch a wholly owned subsidiary in India on April 1 with the aim of investing in that country's power, telecommunications, automobile, chemicals, agriculture and export sectors.</p>
<p>The new firm, Sumitomo Corporation India Ltd, will be capitalised at about $4 million, a Sumitomo spokesman said.</p>
